# The deployable contract is parsed by GenVM's runner-comment reader, which
# reads the first line of the file. Committed contract sources are kept
# LF-only so every checkout — and every deploy path, including a manual CLI
# deploy or a Studio paste from a Windows working copy — sees the same bytes.
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
